/ item-doors 61/63: %!app.type% written alone is the type system: every type with its full facts (a name, its words, its
/ description, its kinds), a structured value its writer lays out. Red before: it wrote only the list of type names.
AppTypeIsTheTypeSystem
- set %system% = "system: %!app.type%"
- assert.contains(Value="description", Container=%system%, Message="the type system carries each type's facts, not only its name")
